learnings:
  - 'The v7 settlement chainLive signal turned out to be exactly the ''real cross-check occurred'' primitive T-005 needed — enforcement satisfaction now rides the same completion signal as learning-loop liveness. The Teeth and the loop closure share one source of truth: a chainLive settlement means real work happened AND was cross-checked.'
  - 'Kit caught a subtle correctness point: capture realVerdicts BEFORE the debrief appends its synthetic ''session'' fallback contribution, so a fabricated/empty session can''t satisfy enforcement via the debrief path. The honesty fix would have had a back-door otherwise.'
